      "title": "Pak Wayan's Rice Field",
      "body": [
        "Pak Wayan is a farmer in a small village in Bali. He wakes up at four in the morning, washes his face, and walks to his rice field. The air is cool, and he can hear the birds singing.",
        "This season, Pak Wayan plants rice in his field. He works with two of his neighbors. They stand in the wet field and put the young plants into the soft mud, one by one.",
        "At noon, his children bring him lunch and a bottle of cold tea. They eat together under a big tree. Pak Wayan is tired but happy. 'A good field gives a good life,' he says with a smile."
      ],
